      "绑定仍然很短。在我缝合封面之前，请带上缺少的纸张、指南针或墨水。"
    ],
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.blank_map_promise.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.missing_proof": [
      "把材料拿过来，我可以把它们装订好。"
    ],
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.blank_map_promise.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.unavailable": [
      "在我合上这本书之前，它还需要纸张、指南针和墨水。"
    ],
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.blank_map_promise.stage.return.scene.leave.lines": [
      "在形成道路之前不要将纸张弄皱。"
    ],
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.blank_map_promise.stage.return.ui.tracker_text": "将作品集材料返回给制图师。",
